+# MODE 2 ("Parked test"): the same floor and every mode-1 gate, with a SCHEDULE instead of the 40 target: ONE staircase
+# per ignition, FCA11_SH_PROBE_STEPS (32 36 40 44 46) for FCA11_SH_PROBE_DWELL_S each, started once the law has held its
+# 30 at a real standstill for FCA11_SH_PROBE_SETTLE_S (no prior motion needed: it is run parked, engaged behind a
+# stationary object). It ABORTS - back to the law's own 30-step hold on the same frame, never to brake-off, never re-run
+# this ignition - on any motion (vEgo > FCA11_SH_PROBE_ABORT_V_MPS or the standstill flag dropping), the ESC's FCA_ACK
+# or StandStill bit dropping, any FCA11 alert state (BRAKE NOW, unavailable, camera braking, divergence, hold nag), and
+# every mode-1 step-aside rule. It can never start once the car has been driven above FCA11_SH_PROBE_MAX_V_SEEN_MPS this
+# ignition, so a mode 2 left on by mistake cannot run the staircase at a red light; after it ends the setting is inert.
+# Pedal: the gas side reads gas_hold (armed by every sent frame >= 4 LSB - the same frames with and without this), so the
+# pedal command is identical: exactly 0 while held. The hold countdown counts sent frames >= 20 steps, which the law was
